                <td>Lower heating element burnt out</td>
                <td>Excessive electrical usage</td>
                <td>Replace element with low-watt-density unit</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Exhaust smell in basement</strong></td>
                <td>Improper flue draft / backdrafting</td>
                <td>Carbon monoxide poisoning risk</td>
                <td>Reline chimney flue and inspect draft hood</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Water dripping from top pipes</strong></td>
                <td>Failed dielectric nipples or washers</td>
                <td>Corrosion of outer tank jacket</td>
                <td>Install brass transition fittings</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Loud popping when burner fires</strong></td>
                <td>Heavy bottom sediment layer</td>
                <td>Premature tank metal fatigue</td>
