        <span class="section-tag">Local Service Corridors</span>
        <h2>Streets & Roads We Regularly Service in Community Park Area</h2>
        <p>
          Our service vehicles provide comprehensive coverage throughout all residential streets, subdivisions, and rural routes in Community Park Area, including:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>South Boulevard:</strong> Complete diagnostics, rapid leak repair, annual maintenance, and emergency replacements.</li>
          <li><strong>Tautphaus Park Access:</strong> Complete diagnostics, rapid leak repair, annual maintenance, and emergency replacements.</li>
          <li><strong>Rollandet Avenue:</strong> Complete diagnostics, rapid leak repair, annual maintenance, and emergency replacements.</li>
          <li><strong>25th Street:</strong> Complete diagnostics, rapid leak repair, annual maintenance, and emergency replacements.</li>
          <li><strong>19th Street:</strong> Complete diagnostics, rapid leak repair, annual maintenance, and emergency replacements.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We also provide prompt dispatch to neighboring districts across Bonneville County. Explore our full regional coverage on our <a href="/locations/">locations hub</a>, or check nearby neighborhood guides including <a href="/locations/ammon/">Ammon</a>, <a href="/locations/downtown-idaho-falls/">Downtown Idaho Falls</a>, and <a href="/locations/snake-river-landing/">Snake River Landing</a>.
        </p>
